<title>SINGAPORE: Singapore bunker final report and prices - July 24.</title>
<headline>Singapore bunker final report and prices - July 24.</headline>
<text>
<p>(DELIVERED U.S.$/TONNE)  380 CST  180 CST    MDO    GAS OIL</p>
<p> SINGAPORE CARGO	   94/96     97/99     UNQ    169/170</p>
<p> SINGAPORE BUNKER	  98/101   100/104  160/165  170/175</p>
<p>--------</p>
<p>COMMENTS - The Singapore bunker market was quiet on Thursday amid a lack of fundamental changes and a little-moved cargo market, traders said. Suppliers said they did not plan to move bunker levels up as demand, though improved recently, was not expected to rise further.</p>
<p>-- Singapore Newsroom (65-870-3571)</p>
